%% 时序图 1：扩展心跳 + 指令 pull + ack（向后兼容）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as sea1 客户端(LicenseGate)
    participant HB as heartbeat.js(富化)
    participant Sys as sysinfo/printer-provider
    participant API as activation-server<br/>(/api/heartbeat)
    participant FS as FleetStore
    participant CH as command-handler(客户端)

    Client->>Sys: 采集 version/cpu/mem/boot + 枚举 printers[]
    Sys-->>HB: Snapshot 字段 + printers[]
    HB->>API: POST /api/heartbeat {machine_id, code, online, version,<br/>public_ip, region, cpu_usage, mem_usage, boot_time,<br/>client_ts, printers[], ack_id?}
    API->>FS: recordHeartbeat(mid, enriched)<br/>+ markAcked(ack_id 若存在)
    FS-->>API: snapshot 更新; pendingCommands
    API-->>HB: 200 {ok, valid, reason,<br/>server_time, license?, commands:[...]}
    HB->>CH: 逐条处理 commands[](restart/disable/notice/config)
    CH-->>HB: 已执行 → 收集 ack_id 列表
    Note over HB: 下次心跳带 ack_id[] 回执（标 acked）

%% 时序图 2：管理员下发指令 → 客户端 ack（状态机）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as 管理员(console.js)
    participant FE as console.js
    participant API as activation-server<br/>(FleetApi)
    participant Auth as ConsoleAuth
    participant FL as FleetService
    participant FS as FleetStore
    participant Audit as ConsoleAudit
    participant Bot as 外网客户端(下次心跳)

    Admin->>FE: 集群详情 → 点「禁用打印机」
    FE->>API: POST /api/admin/fleet/clients/:mid/command<br/>{action:'disable_printer', payload:{printer_id}} x-console-token
    API->>Auth: verifyAuth(req, 2)
    Auth-->>API: {ok:true, level>=2}
    API->>FL: issueCommand(store, fleetStore, mid, action, payload, operator)
    FL->>FS: addCommand(mid, {id, status:'pending', timeoutAt})
    FS-->>FL: Command
    FL->>Audit: logAction({action:'cmd-disable_printer', target:mid, dangerous:true})
    FL-->>API: {ok, commandId, status:'pending'}
    API-->>FE: 200 {ok, commandId}
    FE-->>Admin: Toast「已下发，等待客户端确认」
    Note over Bot: 下次心跳响应携 commands[] → status:'sent'
    Bot->>FS: recordHeartbeat(ack_id=commandId)
    FS->>FS: markAcked → status:'acked'
    Note over Bot: 超时(2×interval)未 ack → timeoutScan 标 'timeout'

%% 时序图 3：异常扫描 → 处置（revoke / blacklist / ignore）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Timer as 定时扫描(fleetScanInterval)
    participant AE as AnomalyEngine
    participant FS as FleetStore
    participant Store as Store
    participant Admin as 管理员
    participant API as FleetApi
    participant Dev as DeviceService
    participant Audit as ConsoleAudit
    participant Bot as 外网客户端

    Timer->>AE: scan(store, fleetStore, cfg)
    AE->>Store: 读 license 过期 / code 绑定
    AE->>FS: 读各 client snapshot/history/printers
    AE-->>FS: 写入 anomalies[]（5 规则去重缓存）
    Note over Admin: 打开「异常」Tab → GET /api/admin/fleet/anomalies
    Admin->>API: POST .../anomalies/code_shared:mid/revoke
    API->>Dev: disable(store, mid)  // 吊销 license
    Dev-->>API: {ok, status:'revoked'}
    API->>Audit: logAction({action:'anomaly-revoke', target:mid})
    API-->>FS: anomaly.status='resolved', disposition='revoke'
    Note over Bot: 下次心跳 reason='revoked' → LicenseGate 降级

    Admin->>API: POST .../anomalies/machine_mismatch:mid/blacklist
    API->>FS: addBlacklist(mid, reason, operator)  // 强制 flush 即时生效
    API->>Audit: logAction({action:'anomaly-blacklist', target:mid})
    Note over Bot: 下次心跳 reason='blacklisted' → 降级

%% 时序图 4：Fleet 模拟器验证（无真机）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as 开发者
    participant Sim as tools/fleet-simulator.js
    participant API as activation-server
    participant FE as console.js(UI 验收)

    Dev->>Sim: node tools/fleet-simulator.js --n 500 --anomaly
    loop 每 heartbeatInterval
        Sim->>API: POST /api/heartbeat（富化字段 + printers[]）
        API-->>Sim: {commands:[]}  // 模拟器执行并 ack
    end
    Dev->>FE: 打开 /console → 集群/打印机/异常
    FE->>API: GET /api/admin/fleet/clients|printers|anomalies
    API-->>FE: 聚合数据（含模拟异常样本）
    FE-->>Dev: 验证 500 台规模下列表/筛选/异常处置
